<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Best in Slot Gear list for Protection Paladin Tank in Cataclysm Classic Pre-Raid. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h2>
<ul>
<li class="fa fa-shield">
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>
<i>Reforging pre-raid</i></b>
<br/>It's relatively simple, since you are not likely to be in danger of exceeding any caps you can and should reforge most stats into Mastery when given the opportunity. However since we want to balance our Parry &amp; Dodge stats, if you have excess of either and can't reforge into mastery, try reforging into whichever avoidance you are lacking the most.</div></li></ul>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="clear"></div>
