<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Shoulders for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67144/pauldrons-of-edward-the-odd">
<img alt="Pauldrons of Edward the Odd" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_raidpaladin_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of Edward the Odd</span></a> are quite solidly ahead of any option here and will remain competitive well into the phase. However when considering the potential cost of a BiS BoE this early on in an expansion, we advise you to be considerate of what 1 item is worth to you before breaking your entire bank.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56452/earthshape-pauldrons">
<img alt="Earthshape Pauldrons" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Earthshape Pauldrons</span></a> is a solid runner up and will get you about as far as the much more expensive BoE option.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58100/pauldrons-of-the-high-requiem">
<img alt="Pauldrons of the High Requiem" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_shoulder_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pauldrons of the High Requiem</span></a> stands out as a hit+exp option, this is extremely aggressively statted for us and if you for some insane reason need DPS this is a great pick.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Shoulder Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=86402/inscription-of-the-earth-prince">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_mastersinscription.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Inscription of the Earth Prince</span></a> &gt; <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62333/greater-inscription-of-unbreakable-quartz">
<img alt="Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_gem_crystal_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Greater Inscription of Unbreakable Quartz</span></a></div>
