<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="back-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Back for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>There is really no other option here, being acquired from reputation means that anyone can access and acquire <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62383/wrap-of-the-great-turtle">
<img alt="Wrap of the Great Turtle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Wrap of the Great Turtle</span></a>. <b>With the exception of</b> <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56304/burned-gatherings">
<img alt="Burned Gatherings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_cataclysm_tank_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Burned Gatherings</span></a>, this cloak has pretty jacked mastery giving you a solid dungeon contender for (pre)BiS.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Cloak Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74234/enchant-cloak-protection">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Cloak - Protection</span></a></div>
<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
<tbody>
<tr>
