<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Chest for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>While there are a lot of options in the chest slot there really isn't much to say on any individual piece. They're chiefly ranked in the order of mastery &amp; avoidance that they can provide to you. As none of the BoEs are hard BiS in the pre-raid, we can not recommend that you go out of your way to pick any of them up for a premium price.<div class="box" data-level="null">
