<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Wrist for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=57870/alpha-bracers">
<img alt="Alpha Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alpha Bracers</span></a> are the wrists of choice here, they are simply better than the competition. <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=67238/terboruss-rotating-bands">
<img alt="Terborus's Rotating Bands" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terborus's Rotating Bands</span></a> do come in as a close #2, however being a BoE from a rare drop these can range from extremely expensive to very cheap. Consider picking these up if you can to save yourself the hassle of looting Alpha Bracers but don't get scammed.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62449/sandguard-bracers">
<img alt="Sandguard Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandguard Bracers</span></a> recieve honorable mentions, but not because they're good. Because they aren't. Rep rewards like these do deserve a special mention because anyone can go and target farm these and get <i>some</i> wrists before they're raid ready. But seriously, don't get these unless you have to.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Wrist Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74229/enchant-bracer-superior-dodge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Superior Dodge</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62256/enchant-bracer-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Stamina</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74239/enchant-bracer-greater-expertise">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Greater Expertise</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74232/enchant-bracer-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Precision</span></a></div>
