<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="hands-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Hands for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>Parry or dodge is what it boils down to, though very narrow <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56428/fingers-of-light">
<img alt="Fingers of Light" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fingers of Light</span></a> should win out slightly all things considered, but <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58105/numbing-handguards">
<img alt="Numbing Handguards" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_plate_dungeonplate_c_04.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Numbing Handguards</span></a> is from JP. Use whichever you get first, don't fret this choice too hard.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Glove Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=82177/quickflip-deflection-plates">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quickflip Deflection Plates</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74255/enchant-gloves-greater-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Gloves - Greater Mastery</span></a>.</div>
