<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Waist for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55059/hardened-elementium-girdle">
<img alt="Hardened Elementium Girdle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hardened Elementium Girdle</span></a> do eke out a lead over the other belts, however in our opinion whatever advantage you win with these are overshadowed by their potential cost. With an alternative like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62384/belt-of-the-ferocious-wolf">
<img alt="Belt of the Ferocious Wolf" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of the Ferocious Wolf</span></a> there is absolutely no need to break your bank.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Waist Enchants</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> is a universal item enhancement for your belt. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">Engineers</a> also get access to a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>.</div>
