<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="legs-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Legs for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>
<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56367/legguards-of-winnowing-wind">
<img alt="Legguards of Winnowing Wind" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legguards of Winnowing Wind</span></a> are the only acceptable pair of legs with mastery on them, giving these a clear advantage over most other legs.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Leg Enchants</b>: <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71720/drakehide-leg-armor">
