<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="feet-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Feet for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>Real choice is lacking here, without any solid substitutes and since it's a fairly prevalent faction, the Twilight Highlands rep boots are a very nice go-to pair with built-in bad luck protection as you can target farm these. If you don't have the time or inclination to farm rep, <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63444/baron-silverlaines-greaves">
<img alt="Baron Silverlaine's Greaves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_plate_dungeonplate_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Baron Silverlaine's Greaves</span></a> are OK and will do their job.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Feet Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74238/enchant-boots-mastery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Mastery</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74253/enchant-boots-lavawalker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulagood_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Lavawalker</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74189/enchant-boots-earthen-vitality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Earthen Vitality</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74236/enchant-boots-precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Precision</span></a></div>
