<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Rings for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>Our best ring setup by a decent margin are <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56444/umbriss-band">
<img alt="Umbriss Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonering2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbriss Band</span></a> &amp; <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62440/red-rock-band">
<img alt="Red Rock Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_kingsring1.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Red Rock Band</span></a>, while on the surface their lack of defensive properties (other than mastery) may appear to set them back, it's not the case. Likewise a non offensive minded user may also reforge these stats into something more to their liking.<br/>
<br/>Since two of our rings on this list are from reputation, you could if you wanted to sorta forego any sort of hopeful grind for <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56444/umbriss-band">
<img alt="Umbriss Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_stonering2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbriss Band</span></a> and opt to get <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62351/felsens-ring-of-resolve">
<img alt="Felsen's Ring of Resolve" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_26.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Felsen's Ring of Resolve</span></a> for peace of mind. But it is a downgrade and not all rings are created equal.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Ring Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74218/enchant-ring-greater-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Greater Stamina</span></a> -  Only Enchanters may apply Ring Enchants on their own rings.</div>
