<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Trinkets for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>As an alchemist one of your first priorities should be to pick up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=58483/lifebound-alchemist-stone">
<img alt="Lifebound Alchemist Stone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_aspiration.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lifebound Alchemist Stone</span></a>, it's an outstanding trinket that is scarcely replaced at all in this entire phase.<br/>
<br/>For others, you do not have a huge selection of choice here, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62466/mirror-of-broken-images">
<img alt="Mirror of Broken Images" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_platnumdisks.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirror of Broken Images</span></a> is a superb trinket if you can and want to use the resistance. If you're just looking for stat sticks however, all options are lacking.<div class="pad"></div>
