<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_aspiration.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lifebound Alchemist Stone</span></a></td>
<td>
<a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=171/alchemy">
<img alt="Alchemy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_alchemy.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Alchemy</span></a></td></tr>
