<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons and Offhands for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="weapons-for-protection-paladin-tank-pre-raid">Weapons for Protection Paladin Tank Pre-Raid</h4>In this pre-raid phase when we're trying to eke out maximized survivability we'll opt for <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56346/elementium-fang">
<img alt="Elementium Fang" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_1h_cataclysm_c_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Fang</span></a>. However if you do pick up <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65171/cookies-tenderizer">
<img alt="Cookie's Tenderizer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_fabric_silk_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cookie's Tenderizer</span></a> beforehand and have it enchanted, just go with it -- it's also very potent on DPS.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64885/scimitar-of-the-sirocco">
<img alt="Scimitar of the Sirocco" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_scimitar-of-the-sirocco.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scimitar of the Sirocco</span></a> exists but is not at all recommended to try and acquire, Archaeology is an extremely time consuming profession and there is no guarantee that you will ever see this in hundreds or thousands of solves.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74244/enchant-weapon-windwalk">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Windwalk</span></a></div>
