<a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=56337/stalagmite-dragon">
<img alt="Stalagmite Dragon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_head_dragon_bronze.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stalagmite Dragon</span></a> does award you slightly better survivability, but the good thing about <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=62243/notched-jawbone">
<img alt="Notched Jawbone" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_trinket_06.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Notched Jawbone</span></a> is that it's crafted. If you run into a streak of bad luck, you could always just buy it.<div class="pad"></div>
